| ----------------- | ----------------- | ------- |
| `frr-filter.yang` | `/frr-filter:lib` | `zebra` |

```bash
grpcurl -plaintext -import-path frrpb -proto frr-northbound.proto -d @ localhost:50051 frr.Northbound/EditCandidate <<'JSON'
